n. So, let me talk of unfairness. Hindi ba unfair? Eh kung ako, babalikan ko rin, sasabihin ko: inimbestigahan ko na rin kahapon. Ang sabi sa akin, mainit ang ulo ni Director Matibag kasi may contractor na raw iyong binigay na lupa para sa NBI at gusto niya sarili niyang contractor. Or would that be fair to him? No. It would be a Marites accusation. So that's the same thing he announced yesterday: a Marites accusation towards me. That affects this Court because I am now a Senator-Judge. So I hope this is the last time that I'm going to have to speak about this. But definitely, we've been speaking about this. Binabawasan talaga kami. Iniisa-isa. Even iyong mga vlogger na malapit sa administration, sabi, two down, three down, may kasunod na. Di ba? So, Mr. President, I

